    "name_raw": "Childlike",
    "definition_type_raw": null,
    "source_book_raw": "Advanced Player’s Guide",
    "definition_raw": "Your resemblance to a human child tends to make others trust you, perhaps more than they should.\n\nPrerequisites: Cha 13, halfling.\n\nBenefit: You can take 10 on Bluff checks to convince others you are telling the truth, so long as your story makes you appear innocent. You gain a +2 bonus on Disguise skill checks to pose as a human child, and ignore the check penalties for disguising yourself as a different race and age category while doing so.",
